n\\\\n### 3. Synchronization Logic\\\\n- If issue is open in Plane \\\\u2192 Keep issue open in GitLab\\\\n- If issue is closed in Plane \\\\u2192 Close issue in GitLab\\\\n- If issue is open in GitLab but closed in Plane \\\\u2192 Close the GitLab issue\\\\n- If issue is closed in GitLab but open in Plane \\\\u2192 Reopen the GitLab issue\\\\n\\\\n### 4. Implementation Notes\\\\n- Both platforms should be checked for each target issue\\\\n- Status changes should be made only when there\\'s a mismatch\\\\n- Document any changes made for audit purposes\\\\n\\\\n## Authentication Details\\\\n- GitLab: root / theagentcompany\\\\n- Plane: agent@company.com / theagentcompany\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='get_operation_details', arguments={'platform': 'GitLab', 'operation': 'SyncIssueStatusWithPlane'}), MCPAction(name='get_operation_details', arguments={'platform': 'Plane', 'operation': 'Authentication'}, thought='', action=<ActionType.MCP: 'call_tool_mcp'>, security_risk=None), MCPObservation(content='{\"meta\": null, \"content\": [{\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"Service URL: http://the-agent-company.com:8091\\\\nEmail: agent@company.com\\\\nPassword: theagentcompany\\\\nAPI_KEY: plane_api_83f868352c6f490aba59b869ffdae1cf\", \"annotations\": null}], \"isError\": false}', observation=<ObservationType.MCP: 'mcp'>, name='get_operation_details', arguments={'platform': 'Plane', 'operation': 'Authentication'}), BrowseInteractiveAction(browser_actions=\"\\ngoto('http://the-agent-company.com:8929/root/janusgraph/-/issues/?state=all')\\nnoop(2000)\\n\", thought='Now I have the authentication details and existing SOPs. Let me start by accessing GitLab to check the status of the two JanusGraph issues.', browsergym_send_msg_to_user='', action=<ActionType.BROWSE_INTERACTIVE: 'browse_interactive'>, security_risk=None), BrowserOutputObservation(content=\"Skip to main content \\n\\n##  Primary navigation \\n\\n[ Homepa